[00:00.00] 作词 : Cassie Wei
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Cassie Wei/Yamato Kasai
[00:16.77] Sleep for a total of 800 hours per day
[00:16.77] 致……请每日睡足八百小时
[00:20.20] And then drink a liter of milk, warm up before you go play
[00:20.20] 喝下一升牛奶，运动前请热身
[00:24.25] Only eat, or write, or pull the trigger with your right hand
[00:24.25] 请在吃饭，写字，或扣下扳机时使用右手
[00:28.30] Only thing that’s left is to work on following commands
[00:28.30] 唯一的准则 即是谨遵指令之意
[00:32.35] By the time you realize, you’ll be restrained to a desk
[00:32.35] 在你意识一切之前，你会被囚禁在书桌之前
[00:36.08] And with your dreams on the floor you comply, eyes chained to the test
[00:36.08] 大脑放空，谨遵指令
[00:40.07] In 30 minutes find a groom or bride, bonus if brunette
[00:40.07] 在30分钟内找到一名伴侣，棕色头发为佳
[00:44.19] In 90 hours spill their insides, paint your room picturesque
[00:44.19] 90小时内挥洒他们的内脏，将房间粉刷一新
[00:49.39] Now it’s time for another vendetta
[00:49.39] 现在，我们解决另一场血仇
[00:56.03] Going through the shelves, picking out my prewritten persona
[00:56.03] 在书架之间穿行，选择我预写的可选人设
[01:03.55] Children of the city sees only the neon stars
[01:03.55] 都市之子目及之处
[01:10.77] Reflected upon the murky gutter sky
[01:10.77] 尽霓虹星光在污水沟之中闪耀
[01:14.84] Don’t ask me why I desperately wish to be included in the city’s night
[01:14.84] 就请不要问我为何想要陷入都市的夜色之中吧
[01:31.58] In 400,000 meters, turn right
[01:31.58] 致……请在400,000米后右转
[01:37.40] Pick up a knife and stab a familiar warm body
[01:37.40] 捡起一把刀，刺入温暖而又熟悉的身体
[01:41.26] Learned to fight before I knew love or bitterness of coffee
[01:41.26] 在我品尝爱或咖啡的苦涩之前，我早已学会战斗
[01:45.35] Snippy scissors cut down the strings, I set myself free
[01:45.35] 唐突地用剪刀剪开我身上的牵线，让自己自由
[01:49.45] Only to figure out everything I chose was by proxy
[01:49.45] 却发现我所做的一切，依旧都在剧本以内
[01:53.60] As we suckled upon the 9mm pacifier
[01:53.60] 当我们吮吸9mm的奶嘴
[01:57.45] Swallowing the fact that other than to expand we had no purpose
[01:57.45] 知晓我们除扩张物种以外毫无意义的事实
[02:01.82] As my everburning will to stay afloat backfires
[02:01.82] 在我的唐突终于引火烧身之时
[02:05.79] I now know I must be comfortable being who I considered worthless
[02:05.79] 我终于明白我必须成为我所不屑的人
[02:10.11] Follow the city’s ribbon
[02:10.11] 随着都市抛出的绶带
[02:13.81] To a heart nobody seems to listen
[02:13.81] 走进一颗未有人倾听过的内心
[02:18.37] It takes my heart being broken and broken again
[02:18.37] 终于知晓一次一次我心碎的原因
[02:22.37] To know that I am the reason why the sufferings never end
[02:22.37] 自我的存在，才让我痛苦永不熄灭
[02:26.36] Now it’s time for another vendetta
[02:26.36] 现在，赴另一场血仇吧
[02:32.69] Going through the shelves, picking out my prewritten persona
[02:32.69] 在书架之间穿梭，带上我早已备好的面具
[02:40.41] Children of the city sees only the neon stars
[02:40.41] 都市之子目及之处
[02:47.61] Reflected upon the murky gutter sky
[02:47.61] 尽霓虹星光在污水沟之中闪耀
[02:51.67] Don’t ask me why I desperately wish to be noticed by the city’s eyes
[02:51.67] 就请别问我为何如此迫切地想被都市所注意
[03:08.06] Do not go home until you finish reading the value of e
[03:08.06] 致……在读完自然常数e之前不要回家
[03:14.00] 2.71 8281 8284 5904 5235 3602 8747 1352 6624 9775 7247 0936 9995 9574 9669 6762…
[03:14.00] 2.718281 82845904 52353602 87471352 66249775 72470936 99959574 96696762